# Build context for the hub's devenv/console images (context: .).
#
# The monorepo root carries ~40 submodule checkouts, their node_modules and the
# local data lake — none of which either image COPYs. Sending them anyway made
# every build stream gigabytes to the daemon, and left `.env` one careless
# `COPY . .` away from being baked into a layer (UPS-REPO-31).
.git
.github
.kilo
.dash-lake
.venv*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
_site
site
node_modules
projects
evolution-workorders
*.log
